Z||000007||Monkeyman||11-27-2001||08:06 PM||||If I can't mount my sub in the trunk, I'll probably mount the amp at the bottom with a Plexiglass cover.  I'll have some sort of framework around the Plexi so I can still put stuff on top (weekend bag, etc).  I still need to figure out a way to build a ported box in the front compartment.  I don't know any other place to mount my sub where it will be out of the way.  I don't want to do a sealed firewall box (was my original idea, but it will take up too much room).  If there was enough space under the dash, that would be ideal, but I don't think there's any way to mount a 10" sub under the dash and have it remain hidden.||||reg||1
